<title>AUSTRALIA: Intellect has A$13 mln Indonesia contract.</title>
<headline>Intellect has A$13 mln Indonesia contract.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic commerce firm Intellect Holdings Ltd said it had signed a A$13 million contract to install 17,000 terminals in Indonesia.</p>
<p>The company, which makes payment systems and smart card readers among other things, did not identify the other parties in the contract.</p>
<p>It said the installation was expected to begin in the calendar 1997 third quarter and completed during the first half of 1998.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
